<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:29.600" end="00:00:34.900" style="s2">Who let this old cleaner near my floor?</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.000" end="00:00:37.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, good morning, madam. The schedule</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.900" end="00:00:39.700" style="s2">states that this floor will be dry by</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.000" end="00:00:41.100" style="s2">8:00 madam.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.700" end="00:00:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry ma.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.100" end="00:00:46.500" style="s2">I have a clean rag in my bucket. Let me</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.000" end="00:00:46.500" style="s2">bring it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.000" end="00:00:50.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I ask for your bucket?</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.900" end="00:00:51.700" style="s2">Look at you</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.100" end="00:00:54.900" style="s2">dripping on my shoe in front of people</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.700" end="00:00:54.900" style="s2">who have paid me good money.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.400" end="00:01:01.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry ma. The buyers are waiting ma.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.200" end="00:01:05.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them wait.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.800" end="00:01:05.800" style="s2">They will learn how a floor is kept.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.200" end="00:01:13.600" style="s2">Wipe it</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.500" end="00:01:13.600" style="s2">with what you are wearing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.200" end="00:01:28.700" style="s2">You see my dear buyers, I check every</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.800" end="00:01:32.000" style="s2">drop myself.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.700" end="00:01:34.600" style="s2">That is why your estate will shine.</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.000" end="00:01:36.800" style="s2">Ma, she is new. Let me</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.600" end="00:01:38.600" style="s2">Now I have two dust bins.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.800" end="00:01:42.500" style="s2">Things go into a dust bin, it carries</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.600" end="00:01:42.500" style="s2">them out and it does not speak.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.100" end="00:01:53.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Phones down please. It is not a cinema.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.200" end="00:01:55.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me your arm ma.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.100" end="00:01:59.100" style="s2">Do not look at them. Look at the floor</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.300" end="00:01:59.100" style="s2">and we will both finish this shift.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.992" end="00:02:09.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am Evie.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.592" end="00:02:12.592" style="s2">Two years on this building.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.992" end="00:02:15.586" style="s2">They call me Mama Sede.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.592" end="00:02:17.392" style="s2">You knelt down beside me this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.586" end="00:02:19.492" style="s2">[music] And you did not even know that</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.392" end="00:02:21.792" style="s2">much.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.492" end="00:02:23.792" style="s2">Somebody was going to kneel, Mama. Eat.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.792" end="00:02:25.792" style="s2">That half is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.792" end="00:02:27.992" style="s2">And what will you eat when you have</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.792" end="00:02:31.992" style="s2">given me your food?</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.992" end="00:02:31.992" style="s2">The other half. I measured it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.392" end="00:02:36.792" style="s2">Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.992" end="00:02:38.792" style="s2">Who is she, that woman?</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.792" end="00:02:40.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was Madame Tamara. She owns this</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.792" end="00:02:44.492" style="s2">tower, the estate in that model, and in</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.992" end="00:02:44.492" style="s2">10 weeks she marries a billionaire.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.792" end="00:02:56.092" style="s2">Even the rubbish, you are arranging it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.592" end="00:03:02.292" style="s2">Bin paper, Mama. I sell it by the kilo.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.592" end="00:03:08.292" style="s2">A cleaner in this town must eat twice.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.092" end="00:03:09.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I cleaned a bank long ago, before you</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.292" end="00:03:12.792" style="s2">were born.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.492" end="00:03:15.692" style="s2">My first supervisor told me, hmm,</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.792" end="00:03:17.892" style="s2">nothing thrown away is ever gone.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.692" end="00:03:19.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, in this building you will first</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.892" end="00:03:22.692" style="s2">learn that nobody looks at the hand</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.892" end="00:03:22.692" style="s2">holding the mop.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.292" end="00:03:26.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am counting on it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.592" end="00:03:43.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madame, you are limping, and there is</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.792" end="00:03:46.192" style="s2">blood on your knee.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.492" end="00:03:46.192" style="s2">Who touched you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.092" end="00:04:00.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years you have driven this family,</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.692" end="00:04:01.492" style="s2">and I have not seen that face on you</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.392" end="00:04:02.194" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.492" end="00:04:03.994" style="s2">Face the road.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.194" end="00:04:05.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, please.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.994" end="00:04:07.194" style="s2">Only a name.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.394" end="00:04:11.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She made the billionaire&#39;s mother wipe</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.194" end="00:04:13.194" style="s2">her shoe, my friend. My son&#39;s bride</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.294" end="00:04:15.894" style="s2">at her own office, in front of</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.194" end="00:04:15.894" style="s2">everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.794" end="00:04:23.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, one call, one call to the</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.794" end="00:04:24.394" style="s2">chairman, and that woman will never</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.094" end="00:04:26.594" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.394" end="00:04:29.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No call. My son believes I am still in</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.594" end="00:04:29.794" style="s2">Houston with my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.894" end="00:04:36.594" style="s2">She has seen me once</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.194" end="00:04:38.594" style="s2">on a telephone, in a gele and full</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.594" end="00:04:41.194" style="s2">makeup.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.594" end="00:04:43.194" style="s2">To my face, she says mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.194" end="00:04:45.194" style="s2">I want to see how she treats the woman</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.194" end="00:04:49.094" style="s2">who empties her bin.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.194" end="00:04:49.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, your own staff have staff.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.994" end="00:05:01.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow, do not be late for your</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.794" end="00:05:01.194" style="s2">cleaner.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.494" end="00:05:21.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, there you are. How is Houston?</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.994" end="00:05:21.794" style="s2">Are you resting?</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.894" end="00:05:29.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am resting,</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.494" end="00:05:30.494" style="s2">my son.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.394" end="00:05:32.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And auntie,</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.494" end="00:05:35.294" style="s2">how is her chest?</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.994" end="00:05:37.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is complaining about the nurses, so</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.294" end="00:05:39.594" style="s2">she is improving.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.494" end="00:05:41.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 weeks, mommy, and you will finally</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.594" end="00:05:44.494" style="s2">sit down with Tamara. Wait until you</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.994" end="00:05:46.494" style="s2">know her. They call her the saint of</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.494" end="00:05:48.494" style="s2">Sapphire Court.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.494" end="00:05:50.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have heard.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.494" end="00:05:53.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She knows every cleaner in that tower by</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.794" end="00:05:56.194" style="s2">name. [laughter] Who does that? Her</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.494" end="00:05:58.494" style="s2">people would walk through fire for her.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.194" end="00:06:00.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every cleaner, that is a heavy thing to</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.494" end="00:06:04.594" style="s2">carry in one head.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.594" end="00:06:04.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will love her. Sleep well, mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.395" end="00:06:15.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let us see the saint.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.695" end="00:06:32.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell them the trucks leave Okpella on</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.195" end="00:06:32.195" style="s2">Monday or they do not leave at all.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.295" end="00:06:49.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Efosa, you came and nobody warned me, so</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.095" end="00:06:49.395" style="s2">you must take me as I am.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.795" end="00:06:53.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This floor is like a mirror. How do you</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.795" end="00:06:55.595" style="s2">keep it?</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.695" end="00:06:57.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With love, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.595" end="00:07:00.295" style="s2">I treat every worker here as my own</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.895" end="00:07:00.295" style="s2">blood.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.495" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother will want to inspect all of</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.295" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">this when she comes home.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.695" end="00:07:12.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her come. There is nothing in this</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.095" end="00:07:12.995" style="s2">building I would hide from your mother.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.395" end="00:07:23.695" style="s2">That is the chairman, Mama. Efosa</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.395" end="00:07:26.295" style="s2">Agbebilli, billionaire she is marrying.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.695" end="00:07:28.095" style="s2">Two years and I have not seen his eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.295" end="00:07:30.695" style="s2">He almost stepped in my bucket and he</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.095" end="00:07:32.495" style="s2">did not see me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.695" end="00:07:36.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not take it to heart.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.495" end="00:07:36.495" style="s2">To them we are furniture that moves.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.470" end="00:07:46.095" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.095" end="00:07:46.095" style="s2">I taught that boy to greet the gate man.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.640" end="00:07:51.660" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.095" end="00:07:56.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have counted those receipts twice</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.695" end="00:07:59.095" style="s2">today, Evi. They will not have children.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.995" end="00:08:00.495" style="s2">We let your big sister admire her</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.095" end="00:08:03.395" style="s2">wealth.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.495" end="00:08:04.195" style="s2">1 million 200,000 naira, three years,</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.395" end="00:08:06.895" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.195" end="00:08:09.897" style="s2">one more installment, and in September</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.895" end="00:08:12.897" style="s2">you sleep a dry room.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.897" end="00:08:15.397" style="s2">Block C, flat six. Waterside living for</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.897" end="00:08:17.697" style="s2">the discerning family. We already have</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.397" end="00:08:18.797" style="s2">waterside living. It comes in under the</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.697" end="00:08:20.497" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.797" end="00:08:22.997" style="s2">I am the nursing student in this room,</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.497" end="00:08:27.397" style="s2">so let me say it. Sickle cell does not</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.997" end="00:08:27.397" style="s2">like cold, and it does not like wet.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.897" end="00:08:31.197" style="s2">I know what the doctor said.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.197" end="00:08:36.597" style="s2">One more rainy season in this room,</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.697" end="00:08:40.097" style="s2">and the next crisis may be the one I</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.597" end="00:08:40.097" style="s2">cannot carry to the clinic.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.597" end="00:08:44.697" style="s2">And you, what will you do with your</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.097" end="00:08:47.936" style="s2">money after?</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.697" end="00:08:49.956" style="s2">Accounts, my accounts.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.936" end="00:08:49.956" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.997" end="00:08:54.597" style="s2">You are the only woman in Benin who</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.697" end="00:08:56.197" style="s2">reads rubbish for pleasure.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.597" end="00:08:59.297" style="s2">It is the one school that has never</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.197" end="00:08:59.297" style="s2">asked me for fees.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.897" end="00:09:20.297" style="s2">No, my love. I ate with the staff today.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.597" end="00:09:22.497" style="s2">They are the reason I wake up in the</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.297" end="00:09:25.497" style="s2">morning. Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.497" end="00:09:25.497" style="s2">God bless you too.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.597" end="00:09:32.497" style="s2">Dustbin.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.097" end="00:09:32.497" style="s2">Pick.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.897" end="00:09:38.497" style="s2">Sorry, ma. Only your signature, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.997" end="00:09:38.497" style="s2">Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.797" end="00:09:44.997" style="s2">Take that thing away.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.697" end="00:09:46.297" style="s2">Nothing leaves this desk without my gold</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.997" end="00:09:50.397" style="s2">ink.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.297" end="00:09:50.397" style="s2">That is how they know the word is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.297" end="00:10:03.397" style="s2">Ma, that one came in this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.197" end="00:10:04.997" style="s2">Should I not copy it first?</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.397" end="00:10:09.397" style="s2">Everything from this desk goes through</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.997" end="00:10:09.397" style="s2">the machine. Nobody reads my paper.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.598" end="00:10:23.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Sedi,</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.798" end="00:10:23.798" style="s2">I am Mr. Felix, your supervisor.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.198" end="00:10:33.298" style="s2">You reported at 2 minutes past 7.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.798" end="00:10:37.898" style="s2">You are to explain in writing within 24</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.298" end="00:10:37.898" style="s2">hours why action should not be taken.</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.698" end="00:10:43.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, sir. Time since anybody wrote</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.798" end="00:10:43.198" style="s2">to me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.198" end="00:10:51.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Also, you are holding that mop like a</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.998" end="00:10:53.698" style="s2">walking stick. Left hand low, right hand</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.598" end="00:10:55.698" style="s2">high. It is in the manual.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.698" end="00:10:58.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which manual, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.698" end="00:10:58.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wrote the manual.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.198" end="00:11:16.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guys, I am inside Sapphire Court right</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.198" end="00:11:19.698" style="s2">now, and the saint herself is about to</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.598" end="00:11:21.398" style="s2">bless her cleaners.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.698" end="00:11:23.998" style="s2">I am not okay.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.398" end="00:11:26.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next in order of seniority, Patience.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.998" end="00:11:28.698" style="s2">Work, please.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.298" end="00:11:31.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10,000 Naira because in this company,</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.698" end="00:11:31.998" style="s2">the cleaner is family.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.398" end="00:11:40.898" style="s2">Hey, 10,000. God don&#39;t see me. If you my</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.398" end="00:11:40.898" style="s2">landlord go greet me today oh.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.798" end="00:11:47.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come, Mama. In this building, you are my</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.898" end="00:11:49.428" style="s2">own mother.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.408" end="00:11:49.428" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.198" end="00:11:53.898" style="s2">This is why they call her the saint,</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.698" end="00:11:57.098" style="s2">guys. Look at that old mama&#39;s face. I am</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.898" end="00:11:57.098" style="s2">crying real tears.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.898" end="00:12:08.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.198" end="00:12:10.198" style="s2">Sorry, everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.898" end="00:12:11.898" style="s2">Madam says the envelopes are for the</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.198" end="00:12:13.699" style="s2">photos.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.898" end="00:12:16.399" style="s2">Bring them back.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.699" end="00:12:17.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring what back? Sister, I have already</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.399" end="00:12:21.099" style="s2">told this money where it&#39;s going. My</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.699" end="00:12:21.099" style="s2">landlord has heard the good news.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.999" end="00:12:25.699" style="s2">Ivi.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.899" end="00:12:28.099" style="s2">Just like that?</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.699" end="00:12:31.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was never in our hands, patience. It</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.099" end="00:12:31.199" style="s2">was only in the picture.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.199" end="00:12:41.699" style="s2">Family does not count money.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.999" end="00:12:48.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10,000.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.299" end="00:12:48.299" style="s2">I have seen people killed for less.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.699" end="00:13:03.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baba Yaro, this is Mama Sedi. She is</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.099" end="00:13:05.399" style="s2">new, so please do not cheat me in front</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.099" end="00:13:05.399" style="s2">of her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.099" end="00:13:12.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This scale is older than you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.999" end="00:13:16.099" style="s2">It has never told a lie</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.299" end="00:13:16.099" style="s2">and it has never given a discount.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.099" end="00:13:26.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This paper is half of my installment,</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.899" end="00:13:26.199" style="s2">Mama. The other half is my stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.099" end="00:13:35.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Floor, date.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.799" end="00:13:37.299" style="s2">Why are you tagging rubbish, my child?</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.399" end="00:13:38.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because Baba pays more for clean office</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.299" end="00:13:41.599" style="s2">paper</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.499" end="00:13:44.699" style="s2">and because I read, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.599" end="00:13:46.699" style="s2">Nobody stops a cleaner from reading.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.699" end="00:13:48.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She reads everything.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.699" end="00:13:51.499" style="s2">One day she read my own books to me and</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.999" end="00:13:51.499" style="s2">I paid her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.499" end="00:13:59.399" style="s2">All of this waits for the mill truck.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.899" end="00:13:59.399" style="s2">It comes four times a year.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.599" end="00:14:04.899" style="s2">The next one, the last Saturday of</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.099" end="00:14:06.199" style="s2">September at dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.899" end="00:14:08.999" style="s2">After that,</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.199" end="00:14:10.699" style="s2">all this is toilet roll.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.999" end="00:14:13.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then a person who lost something has</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.699" end="00:14:16.301" style="s2">until that Saturday to find it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.799" end="00:14:19.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, nobody comes here to find. Them</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.301" end="00:14:19.101" style="s2">only come to sell.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.201" end="00:14:27.501" style="s2">These are not new hands.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.501" end="00:14:42.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, your shoes are on my wet step.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.001" end="00:14:53.801" style="s2">Drink this, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.801" end="00:14:56.501" style="s2">You look ill.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.801" end="00:14:58.201" style="s2">I would say the same to the gate man.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.501" end="00:15:00.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is in it?</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.201" end="00:15:02.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Millet, ginger, and no opinion about</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.701" end="00:15:02.901" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.501" end="00:15:09.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know who I am?</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.601" end="00:15:12.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do, yes, sir. You have passed me about</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.501" end="00:15:12.501" style="s2">400 times.</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.501" end="00:15:17.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Most people in this building stand up</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.201" end="00:15:17.801" style="s2">when I come in.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.601" end="00:15:23.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Most people in this building are not</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.101" end="00:15:25.801" style="s2">holding a mop, sir. If I sit down, who</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.401" end="00:15:27.801" style="s2">will dry your step?</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.801" end="00:15:29.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is your name?</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.801" end="00:15:30.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are the first person in this tower</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.401" end="00:15:33.601" style="s2">to ask.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.701" end="00:15:35.601" style="s2">It is Evi, sir. The 14th floor and these</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.601" end="00:15:39.101" style="s2">stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.601" end="00:15:41.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evi, today is the day my father died.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.101" end="00:15:44.401" style="s2">Up there they are drinking to my wedding</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.401" end="00:15:46.201" style="s2">and nobody has remembered the date.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.401" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">He used to know every gate man&#39;s child</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.201" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">in the company by name.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.501" end="00:15:53.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every child, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.501" end="00:15:56.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He once stopped the car in the rain to</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.201" end="00:15:59.001" style="s2">ask a man about his daughter&#39;s exam.</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.901" end="00:16:01.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he was worth remembering. And you,</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.001" end="00:16:01.301" style="s2">sir?</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.101" end="00:16:11.401" style="s2">Mind the fourth step. It is still wet.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.601" end="00:16:24.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love dinner. I did not come for the</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.402" end="00:16:25.902" style="s2">food.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.102" end="00:16:27.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, with respect, the schedule is in</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.902" end="00:16:29.402" style="s2">hand. We have every intention, madam and</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.902" end="00:16:32.802" style="s2">I.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.402" end="00:16:36.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is this man and why is he wet?</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.802" end="00:16:38.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kester is my finance director.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.002" end="00:16:42.402" style="s2">Kester, stop talking.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.802" end="00:16:45.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1.8 billion naira.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.402" end="00:16:45.702" style="s2">The Monday after your wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.902" end="00:16:52.002" style="s2">If he does not come,</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.102" end="00:16:55.702" style="s2">I sell what I hold</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.002" end="00:16:58.102" style="s2">and I tell the newspapers why.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.702" end="00:17:01.302" style="s2">I am saying this politely because I am</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.102" end="00:17:01.302" style="s2">told you are a saint.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.702" end="00:17:07.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That Saturday night</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.602" end="00:17:10.002" style="s2">in front of 600 people for Sapphire</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.502" end="00:17:10.002" style="s2">Court.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.302" end="00:17:17.002" style="s2">It is his wedding gift.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.402" end="00:17:21.602" style="s2">It pays you, it pays you, it pays me,</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.002" end="00:17:21.602" style="s2">and by Sunday I am a very rich wife.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.802" end="00:17:30.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saint.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.002" end="00:17:30.702" style="s2">I like that.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.702" end="00:17:35.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tamara,</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.902" end="00:17:37.602" style="s2">if one of Efosa&#39;s lawyers drives out to</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.702" end="00:17:40.102" style="s2">look at that land, one visit we are</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.602" end="00:17:40.102" style="s2">finished.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.602" end="00:17:51.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until that pen moves, nobody looks at</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.802" end="00:17:51.202" style="s2">Block C and nobody looks in my bin.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.002" end="00:18:00.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Houston has no mop.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.302" end="00:18:04.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam,</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.402" end="00:18:06.502" style="s2">30 years I have worn a pressed uniform.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.102" end="00:18:08.502" style="s2">Today the boys at the Kekere Park asked</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.502" end="00:18:12.802" style="s2">me for union dues.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.502" end="00:18:12.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son has told his bride 4:00.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.502" end="00:18:17.402" style="s2">If I miss it, he will telephone my</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.202" end="00:18:19.757" style="s2">sister&#39;s house. And then what will you</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.402" end="00:18:21.777" style="s2">drive?</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.757" end="00:18:21.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.003" end="00:18:32.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I greet you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.203" end="00:18:32.203" style="s2">I pray for your knees every morning.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.303" end="00:18:40.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My knees, thank you, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.303" end="00:18:41.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such a beautiful curtain, mommy. Is that</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.003" end="00:18:43.903" style="s2">your sister&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.903" end="00:18:45.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She chose it herself.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.903" end="00:18:47.703" style="s2">She is improving.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.903" end="00:18:50.303" style="s2">So nobody is allowed to tell her the</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.703" end="00:18:50.303" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.703" end="00:18:54.403" style="s2">Mama Sede,</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.303" end="00:18:57.203" style="s2">who there inside? Why you locked door</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.403" end="00:18:57.203" style="s2">for afternoon?</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.303" end="00:19:03.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, that cough.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.503" end="00:19:08.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is the American air, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.903" end="00:19:10.803" style="s2">They put too much ice in it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.603" end="00:19:13.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, mommy. When you come home, I will</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.803" end="00:19:17.003" style="s2">wash your feet myself.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.603" end="00:19:17.003" style="s2">I will bring them to you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.603" end="00:19:27.503" style="s2">That old woman will be in a care home by</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.703" end="00:19:27.503" style="s2">Christmas.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.903" end="00:19:31.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Sede, penthouse dey ring. Madam</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.403" end="00:19:34.003" style="s2">want her tea.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.803" end="00:19:37.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold Houston for me, Goddy.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.003" end="00:19:37.503" style="s2">The penthouse wants its tea.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.803" end="00:19:46.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Queen, I asked for the cover of that</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.503" end="00:19:47.403" style="s2">magazine and you have given me page</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.403" end="00:19:48.703" style="s2">nine.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.403" end="00:19:51.203" style="s2">Is that head only for holding up a</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.703" end="00:19:51.203" style="s2">fringe?</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.603" end="00:19:54.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.003" end="00:19:57.903" style="s2">Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.903" end="00:19:57.903" style="s2">They told me, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.303" end="00:20:10.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dustbin.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.803" end="00:20:11.303" style="s2">Bare hands. I want every piece.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.103" end="00:20:13.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma,</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.303" end="00:20:16.203" style="s2">it is sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.103" end="00:20:16.203" style="s2">Let me bring the brush.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:20.503" style="s2">Did I say brush?</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.303" end="00:20:25.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That bottle crossed an ocean to reach</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.405" end="00:20:28.105" style="s2">this desk.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.705" end="00:20:30.905" style="s2">Whose fault is this?</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.105" end="00:20:30.905" style="s2">Someone will pay.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.705" end="00:20:38.105" style="s2">I knocked it, ma. I came for the bin and</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.005" end="00:20:38.105" style="s2">I turned too fast.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.005" end="00:20:44.505" style="s2">So my dustbin has elbows.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.305" end="00:20:45.805" style="s2">One week off without pay and that bottle</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.505" end="00:20:48.005" style="s2">comes out of your installment.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.805" end="00:20:48.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ma.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.305" end="00:20:59.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did not touch that bottle.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.005" end="00:21:01.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I read that girl&#39;s bin, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.105" end="00:21:04.305" style="s2">Her job is her mother&#39;s rent.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.805" end="00:21:05.805" style="s2">Mine is only my job.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.305" end="00:21:07.805" style="s2">One week for a girl who has never</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.805" end="00:21:09.805" style="s2">greeted you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.805" end="00:21:12.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold still. This is the only blue thing</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.805" end="00:21:12.905" style="s2">in the building I can afford.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.905" end="00:21:21.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pepper soup.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.305" end="00:21:24.205" style="s2">A woman sent home without pay should not</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.405" end="00:21:26.305" style="s2">also go without pepper.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.205" end="00:21:28.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, you crossed this town in that</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.305" end="00:21:28.605" style="s2">rain.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.405" end="00:21:34.405" style="s2">Come in before</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.705" end="00:21:37.105" style="s2">before</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.405" end="00:21:38.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We, feet up. Papers first, then pots,</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.105" end="00:21:40.105" style="s2">then us.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.505" end="00:21:45.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, stand on the step.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.105" end="00:21:45.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evi, it has started in my legs.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.105" end="00:21:50.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long have you lived like this, my</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.605" end="00:21:53.905" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.905" end="00:21:56.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In one room or another, a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.905" end="00:21:57.505" style="s2">When our father died, his people took</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.005" end="00:22:00.105" style="s2">the house.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.505" end="00:22:03.205" style="s2">They put my mother&#39;s pot on the road</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.105" end="00:22:05.105" style="s2">and told us we were nobodies.</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.205" end="00:22:07.005" style="s2">I was 12.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.105" end="00:22:09.905" style="s2">So when I get a door, mama, I want my</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.005" end="00:22:09.905" style="s2">own name on it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.705" end="00:22:19.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the clinic.</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.505" end="00:22:22.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, you earn what I earned. I do not</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.505" end="00:22:27.005" style="s2">take from cleaners and I do not beg.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.805" end="00:22:27.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is not begging when nobody has asked.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.005" end="00:22:28.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.206" end="00:22:32.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; put it away please and pass me that</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.706" end="00:22:32.406" style="s2">cloth. This one has gone cold.</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.306" end="00:22:38.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A pot on the road can still cook my</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.306" end="00:22:40.406" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.806" end="00:22:43.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It cooked mama. That is why you are</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.406" end="00:22:43.106" style="s2">looking at me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.206" end="00:22:47.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivi</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.306" end="00:22:47.106" style="s2">my back.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.906" end="00:22:53.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open the door mama. I can still carry</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.006" end="00:22:53.206" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.606" end="00:23:07.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivi you not supposed stay here. Woman we</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.206" end="00:23:09.206" style="s2">collect 10,000 back for photo now she go</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.306" end="00:23:11.306" style="s2">give you advance.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.206" end="00:23:13.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I beg go home.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.306" end="00:23:15.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister is on a clinic bed patients</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.906" end="00:23:18.506" style="s2">and they want 85,000 naira before she</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.906" end="00:23:18.506" style="s2">leaves it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.006" end="00:23:30.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good day ma. My sister is sick. Please I</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.906" end="00:23:33.706" style="s2">am asking for my salary in advance.</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.206" end="00:23:33.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Felix who is this?</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.906" end="00:23:38.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Staff card madam as requested. The</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.206" end="00:23:40.706" style="s2">employee is presently on suspension</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.006" end="00:23:42.606" style="s2">madam so strictly</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.706" end="00:23:45.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivi Idahosa</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.606" end="00:23:48.206" style="s2">block C flat 6 installment buyer. My</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.706" end="00:23:51.106" style="s2">dustbin has bought a flat in my estate.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.206" end="00:23:53.206" style="s2">Should I warn the neighbors?</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.106" end="00:23:55.121" style="s2">Ma please will she use the service lift</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.206" end="00:23:57.086" style="s2">to reach HER OWN BEDROOM?</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.121" end="00:23:59.106" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.086" end="00:23:59.106" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.206" end="00:24:04.806" style="s2">MA</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.306" end="00:24:06.406" style="s2">YOU ARE HOLDING 1,200 200,000 naira of</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.806" end="00:24:09.706" style="s2">my money.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.406" end="00:24:14.006" style="s2">I am asking only for what I have worked</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.706" end="00:24:14.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your sister is sick. Sell your receipts.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.106" end="00:24:26.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you ma. I will be back on Monday</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.406" end="00:24:26.106" style="s2">for my floor.</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.707" end="00:24:36.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bus fare.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.207" end="00:24:38.107" style="s2">There is no form for this, therefore it</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.307" end="00:24:40.707" style="s2">did not happen.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.107" end="00:24:40.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.007" end="00:24:46.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For what? I am reading my clipboard.</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.107" end="00:24:58.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is the first of it, sir. The rest</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.807" end="00:25:00.007" style="s2">comes monthly.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.908" end="00:25:02.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Efe,</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.007" end="00:25:04.107" style="s2">the 14th floor and the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.408" end="00:25:06.107" style="s2">What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.107" end="00:25:10.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The clinic told me that one Mr. Efo has</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.107" end="00:25:12.607" style="s2">settled my sister&#39;s bill, 85,000 naira.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.107" end="00:25:14.107" style="s2">I did not ask you, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.607" end="00:25:16.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your supervisor sent my office a</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.107" end="00:25:19.007" style="s2">memorandum in three copies stating that</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.908" end="00:25:21.107" style="s2">it had never been sent.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.007" end="00:25:23.408" style="s2">It was a gift.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.107" end="00:25:25.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what it was. A gift from the top</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.408" end="00:25:27.908" style="s2">of the stairs is how people like me stop</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.307" end="00:25:27.908" style="s2">being people.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.107" end="00:25:34.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave me kunu and I did not pay for</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.107" end="00:25:36.507" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.307" end="00:25:39.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then that is 200 naira, sir. Take it off</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.507" end="00:25:39.107" style="s2">the balance.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.507" end="00:25:52.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Received from Efe Idahosa, 4,000 naira.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.207" end="00:25:56.607" style="s2">Balance, 81,000 less one kunu.</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.908" end="00:25:59.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is not a figure, sir. 80,000.</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.607" end="00:25:59.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 80,800.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.882" end="00:26:02.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.908" end="00:26:11.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, have you seen Block C with your own</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.707" end="00:26:14.207" style="s2">eyes?</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.507" end="00:26:14.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Photographs.</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.707" end="00:26:27.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, you have seen enough. Your blood</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.807" end="00:26:28.707" style="s2">is on her glass.</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.408" end="00:26:30.809" style="s2">Tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.707" end="00:26:32.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell him what? That she was rude to</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.809" end="00:26:34.609" style="s2">cleaner.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.009" end="00:26:36.709" style="s2">Six years ago, I spoke against a girl, a</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.609" end="00:26:39.709" style="s2">girl.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.709" end="00:26:41.309" style="s2">And he did not phone me for a year.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.709" end="00:26:42.509" style="s2">That is why I went to Houston and</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.309" end="00:26:46.109" style="s2">stayed.</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.509" end="00:26:46.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, this one cut your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.309" end="00:26:54.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He will say Mommy hid in a cupboard</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.909" end="00:26:54.109" style="s2">to judge his wife, to judge his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.909" end="00:26:59.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.309" end="00:26:59.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need more than my feelings.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.009" end="00:27:05.728" style="s2">It is the only honest letter I have had</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.409" end="00:27:07.038" style="s2">all year.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.728" end="00:27:09.058" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.038" end="00:27:09.058" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.109" end="00:27:18.509" style="s2">My son, my daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.709" end="00:27:20.909" style="s2">before any Benin bride is wedded,</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.509" end="00:27:23.309" style="s2">she takes all her workers, the cleaners</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.909" end="00:27:24.909" style="s2">too, to bless the ground of her first</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.309" end="00:27:28.009" style="s2">estate.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.909" end="00:27:30.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, that is beautiful. Tamara?</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.009" end="00:27:31.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of them, Mommy, on the site?</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.509" end="00:27:36.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of them.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.909" end="00:27:36.009" style="s2">I want to hear that the cleaners ate.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.409" end="00:27:41.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is my joy, Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.909" end="00:27:46.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, your thumb.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.909" end="00:27:52.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody looks at an old woman&#39;s thumb.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.809" end="00:28:07.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This was in the old land file, Tamara,</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.309" end="00:28:10.509" style="s2">in an open cabinet where any clerk could</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.609" end="00:28:10.509" style="s2">put his hand on it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.109" end="00:28:18.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who else has seen it?</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.809" end="00:28:18.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody. Nobody, I swear to you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.109" end="00:28:24.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the old woman, Kester, that is</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.409" end="00:28:24.009" style="s2">furniture.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.609" end="00:28:34.510" style="s2">And this blessing of the ground, three</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.609" end="00:28:37.610" style="s2">buses on that road with a whole crowd</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.510" end="00:28:37.610" style="s2">looking out of the windows.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.110" end="00:28:41.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.710" end="00:28:44.610" style="s2">My mother in law wants a prayer, so she</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.810" end="00:28:44.610" style="s2">will have a prayer.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.510" end="00:28:53.310" style="s2">They stay inside the show house. They</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.410" end="00:28:55.110" style="s2">eat rice, they cry at the kitchen,</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.310" end="00:28:58.010" style="s2">and they go home.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.110" end="00:29:01.210" style="s2">Nobody walks past the trees.</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.010" end="00:29:03.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if somebody wanders?</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.210" end="00:29:07.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is free food, Kester.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.810" end="00:29:07.010" style="s2">Nobody wanders.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.210" end="00:29:11.510" style="s2">Thank to the mind cold.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.710" end="00:29:22.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A woman who sells houses.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.710" end="00:29:27.920" style="s2">What is that word doing in her bag?</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.900" end="00:29:27.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.110" end="00:29:36.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kester, slowly. You are dripping down</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.310" end="00:29:39.410" style="s2">the telephone. Queen, what is it?</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.610" end="00:29:42.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, it is a petition from the buyers</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.410" end="00:29:42.410" style="s2">about block C.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.710" end="00:29:47.610" style="s2">40 families have signed.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.710" end="00:29:49.310" style="s2">They ask why nothing is rising behind</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.610" end="00:29:52.010" style="s2">the trees and they are asking for a</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.310" end="00:29:52.010" style="s2">refund, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.910" end="00:29:57.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 40 families and you want to answer them,</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.510" end="00:30:01.510" style="s2">Kester?</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.210" end="00:30:01.510" style="s2">Answer them with what? They only pay.</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.810" end="00:30:17.710" style="s2">Through the machine, Queen, where nobody</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.410" end="00:30:19.610" style="s2">is about. Send them a calendar with a</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.710" end="00:30:22.710" style="s2">swimming pool on it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.610" end="00:30:27.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, should I keep one copy for the file?</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.710" end="00:30:27.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no file. There is the machine.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.401" end="00:30:33.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.012" end="00:30:42.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry. You were not here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.112" end="00:30:58.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one held onto my sleeve. The rest</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.112" end="00:30:58.712" style="s2">came out of the penthouse machine.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.912" end="00:31:03.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Flood.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.712" end="00:31:04.612" style="s2">Mama, 40 families wrote to her about</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.212" end="00:31:05.912" style="s2">block C</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.612" end="00:31:07.912" style="s2">and I heard her laugh at them in the</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.912" end="00:31:10.912" style="s2">mirror.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.912" end="00:31:13.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then look at this rubbish, my child.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.912" end="00:31:15.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can it be read? If paper can be read, I</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.412" end="00:31:18.212" style="s2">can read it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.312" end="00:31:18.212" style="s2">I can read it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.216" end="00:31:22.912" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.512" end="00:31:22.912" style="s2">Look.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.212" end="00:31:28.812" style="s2">I have found a whole word.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.712" end="00:31:31.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have, Mama, and you have stuck it</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.812" end="00:31:33.512" style="s2">upside down.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.212" end="00:31:35.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let it lie that way. It has had a hard</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.512" end="00:31:35.912" style="s2">week.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.512" end="00:31:43.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paper, dear Madam, na love letter o.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.812" end="00:31:45.112" style="s2">Madam dey tear love letter. Chairman,</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.812" end="00:31:47.212" style="s2">don&#39;t try.</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.112" end="00:31:49.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Patience, sit down,</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.212" end="00:31:52.612" style="s2">hold this ruler</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.112" end="00:31:52.612" style="s2">and let the chairman rest.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.212" end="00:31:59.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Witnesses.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.612" end="00:32:01.312" style="s2">Mama Sade,</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.012" end="00:32:04.012" style="s2">this is a query.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.312" end="00:32:05.812" style="s2">On Tuesday, you mopped the 14th floor so</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.012" end="00:32:07.612" style="s2">well that it embarrassed your</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.812" end="00:32:10.512" style="s2">colleagues.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.612" end="00:32:12.712" style="s2">You are to explain yourself in writing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.512" end="00:32:15.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oga Felix, you dey query person because</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.712" end="00:32:17.812" style="s2">floor clean?</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.212" end="00:32:20.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Standards must rise evenly, Patience. It</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.812" end="00:32:20.612" style="s2">is in the manual.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.712" end="00:32:26.112" style="s2">Also, this hobby of yours is using a</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.612" end="00:32:26.112" style="s2">great deal of company tape.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.682" end="00:32:28.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.512" end="00:32:40.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sapphire Court, block C.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.812" end="00:32:40.313" style="s2">That is a crest, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.013" end="00:32:48.313" style="s2">Why would she shred my house?</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.013" end="00:32:59.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Balance 78,800. I checked it twice.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.613" end="00:33:01.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are improving, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.613" end="00:33:02.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a report.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.313" end="00:33:05.013" style="s2">The man at my north gate has four</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.913" end="00:33:06.913" style="s2">children and the eldest wants to fly</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.013" end="00:33:09.113" style="s2">airplanes.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.913" end="00:33:11.313" style="s2">Our Weybridge clerk has twins. I know</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.113" end="00:33:13.313" style="s2">all the names. Test me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.313" end="00:33:16.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How will I mark it, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.313" end="00:33:17.113" style="s2">I do not have the answers.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.013" end="00:33:19.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you will have to trust the</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.113" end="00:33:20.913" style="s2">chairman.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.113" end="00:33:23.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stand up, sir, and I will teach you</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.913" end="00:33:23.813" style="s2">something useful.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.013" end="00:33:29.413" style="s2">This fourth step dips in the middle and</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.113" end="00:33:33.713" style="s2">it holds the water longest.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.413" end="00:33:33.713" style="s2">Keep to the wall side and you will live.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.733" end="00:33:40.753" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.813" end="00:33:46.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that is what it sounds like.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.813" end="00:33:50.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, your left foot is drowning.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.313" end="00:33:57.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother would like you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.413" end="00:33:59.813" style="s2">She is in Houston with her sister.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.913" end="00:34:01.413" style="s2">She cleaned a bank once when she was</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.813" end="00:34:03.913" style="s2">young.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.413" end="00:34:06.613" style="s2">I do not tell people that.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.913" end="00:34:06.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.553" end="00:34:09.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.613" end="00:34:21.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good night, Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.613" end="00:34:24.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good night, chairman.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.913" end="00:34:46.114" style="s2">My dear families, this is the ground you</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.014" end="00:34:49.114" style="s2">trusted me today. It is blessed and very</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.114" end="00:34:49.114" style="s2">soon it is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.439" end="00:34:53.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.114" end="00:35:00.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our vision is now a reality.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.614" end="00:35:03.714" style="s2">Do not thank me for this day. Thank my</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.714" end="00:35:03.714" style="s2">mother in Houston.</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.214" end="00:35:09.914" style="s2">She says no bride should marry in Benin</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.314" end="00:35:13.414" style="s2">until her workers have blessed her</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.914" end="00:35:13.414" style="s2">ground. Clean us too.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.214" end="00:35:23.814" style="s2">Thank you, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.814" end="00:35:33.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This way, my love.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.614" end="00:35:33.114" style="s2">They came for your good side.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.814" end="00:35:43.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Single line, please.</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.714" end="00:35:46.214" style="s2">You may admire the taps. You may not</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.914" end="00:35:49.114" style="s2">test the taps.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.214" end="00:35:53.614" style="s2">Patients, that lemon is a display lemon.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.114" end="00:35:53.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Efe, see kitchen we no get smoke.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.814" end="00:36:02.214" style="s2">When you enter your flat, I dey come</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.214" end="00:36:05.214" style="s2">every Sunday for rice and I go bring my</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.214" end="00:36:05.214" style="s2">landlord make him cry.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.114" end="00:36:21.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, sir. I have seen the show house.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.114" end="00:36:23.214" style="s2">Where is Block C?</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.414" end="00:36:25.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Phase two, behind the trees, sister.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.214" end="00:36:25.914" style="s2">Enjoy the rice.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.814" end="00:36:43.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon, Baba. Please, what is</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.714" end="00:36:43.214" style="s2">that pole?</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.514" end="00:36:46.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one?</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.914" end="00:36:49.616" style="s2">The river&#39;s rent book.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.816" end="00:36:51.416" style="s2">Every year I paint where she came.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.616" end="00:36:53.416" style="s2">She is the only tenant in Benin who</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.416" end="00:36:56.516" style="s2">never misses</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.416" end="00:36:56.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Came where, Baba?</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.916" end="00:37:00.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.316" end="00:37:02.716" style="s2">October, this ground where you stand,</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.316" end="00:37:04.816" style="s2">she sleeps here up to that red ground.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.716" end="00:37:06.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Baba. They are building here. It is</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.816" end="00:37:08.516" style="s2">on the brochure, Block C.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.716" end="00:37:11.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.516" end="00:37:13.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have paid for it, flat six.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.016" end="00:37:14.316" style="s2">3 years</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.016" end="00:37:16.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Flat six?</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.316" end="00:37:18.160" style="s2">Then beg them for a top The ground floor</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.216" end="00:37:20.180" style="s2">is for tilapia.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.160" end="00:37:20.180" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.716" end="00:37:24.316" style="s2">Today she stands at the third white</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.016" end="00:37:25.816" style="s2">band.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.316" end="00:37:27.516" style="s2">With this rain,</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.816" end="00:37:30.116" style="s2">she will touch the red before the month</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.516" end="00:37:30.116" style="s2">finishes.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.416" end="00:37:47.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama,</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.516" end="00:37:50.716" style="s2">I told my sister September.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.616" end="00:37:50.716" style="s2">I told her a dry room.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.186" end="00:37:56.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.316" end="00:38:05.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To Miss Tamara Eketor, Block C and all</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.016" end="00:38:09.216" style="s2">land past the show house, floodplain,</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.516" end="00:38:11.916" style="s2">title revoked, no building permitted.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.216" end="00:38:14.316" style="s2">There is a date, my child.</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.916" end="00:38:16.016" style="s2">Read me the date.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.316" end="00:38:17.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2 years ago, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.016" end="00:38:20.716" style="s2">She has known for 2 years and she took</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.716" end="00:38:20.716" style="s2">my money last month.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.416" end="00:38:31.116" style="s2">412 families,</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.616" end="00:38:32.516" style="s2">not one block standing.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.116" end="00:38:34.616" style="s2">For a year I have been reading her</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.516" end="00:38:38.616" style="s2">transfer slips before I sell them, and</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.616" end="00:38:38.616" style="s2">every naira goes to one lender in Lagos.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.316" end="00:38:45.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.516" end="00:38:45.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She sold us flats on a river, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.816" end="00:38:51.717" style="s2">On the wedding the chairman&#39;s money</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.617" end="00:38:54.917" style="s2">money pays her debt.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.717" end="00:38:54.917" style="s2">And we keep the receipts.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.017" end="00:38:59.717" style="s2">Nothing thrown away is ever gone. You</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.917" end="00:39:03.117" style="s2">said so.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.717" end="00:39:03.117" style="s2">I am what she threw away.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.517" end="00:39:14.217" style="s2">Mama, what is this?</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.317" end="00:39:17.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My first one.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.217" end="00:39:19.717" style="s2">It has survived worse women.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.617" end="00:39:21.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let us carry this page to somebody</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.717" end="00:39:23.117" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.417" end="00:39:25.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Torn paper from a cleaner&#39;s table is</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.117" end="00:39:28.017" style="s2">forgery in her mouth. My lawyer gets the</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.517" end="00:39:30.517" style="s2">ministry stamped copy on Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.017" end="00:39:32.517" style="s2">Wait for it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.517" end="00:39:34.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What lawyer, mama? We share one plate of</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.517" end="00:39:36.917" style="s2">beans.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.017" end="00:39:36.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A relative.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.917" end="00:39:51.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A whole week early. My accountants</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.917" end="00:39:53.817" style="s2">should come and learn from you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.117" end="00:39:56.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not why I came, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.817" end="00:39:57.817" style="s2">Somebody I respect told me to wait. I</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.517" end="00:39:59.717" style="s2">cannot.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.817" end="00:40:01.717" style="s2">You told me photographs, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.717" end="00:40:03.217" style="s2">Yesterday you you stood at that show</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.717" end="00:40:05.217" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.217" end="00:40:07.917" style="s2">I walked behind the trees.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.217" end="00:40:11.717" style="s2">Block C is one signboard.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.917" end="00:40:11.717" style="s2">And the river is standing behind it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.817" end="00:40:15.517" style="s2">This is the Ministry of Lands two years</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.117" end="00:40:17.717" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.517" end="00:40:19.517" style="s2">The title is revoked.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.717" end="00:40:21.517" style="s2">There is a boatman&#39;s pole out there with</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.517" end="00:40:24.017" style="s2">the watermark on it, and she has gone on</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.517" end="00:40:24.017" style="s2">selling.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.217" end="00:40:29.717" style="s2">When you sign at your wedding, your</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.917" end="00:40:33.317" style="s2">money pays her debt.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.717" end="00:40:34.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ife, these are serious words.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.317" end="00:40:36.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They are not mine.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.917" end="00:40:39.817" style="s2">I was on my knees in the washroom when</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.517" end="00:40:39.817" style="s2">40 families wrote to her.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.317" end="00:40:45.117" style="s2">She said it to her own mirror, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.917" end="00:40:47.317" style="s2">Poor people do not read.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.117" end="00:40:49.017" style="s2">They only pay.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.317" end="00:40:49.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you get this?</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.017" end="00:40:51.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.218" end="00:40:53.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; her shredder bag.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.318" end="00:40:55.318" style="s2">I carry it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.818" end="00:40:57.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have been going through my fiance&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.318" end="00:40:58.918" style="s2">rubbish.</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.118" end="00:41:00.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have been reading what was thrown at</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.918" end="00:41:02.718" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.718" end="00:41:05.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what that floor did to you. I</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.718" end="00:41:07.468" style="s2">heard about the microphone.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.448" end="00:41:07.468" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.518" end="00:41:14.418" style="s2">A person who has been laughed at can</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.218" end="00:41:16.618" style="s2">find many things in a torn page.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.418" end="00:41:18.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that is what I am now, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.618" end="00:41:21.518" style="s2">Bitter.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.818" end="00:41:24.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will ask Tamara myself quietly today.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.518" end="00:41:26.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you will warn her, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.443" end="00:41:26.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.518" end="00:41:45.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I must ask you one thing, Tamara.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.818" end="00:41:48.018" style="s2">And I want you to forgive me for asking.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.818" end="00:41:50.118" style="s2">I have been shown a ministry letter. It</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.018" end="00:41:53.918" style="s2">says Block C is flood plain and that</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.118" end="00:41:53.918" style="s2">your title was revoked two years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.918" end="00:42:00.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That letter is real, my love. We</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.918" end="00:42:02.518" style="s2">appealed it and we won.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.318" end="00:42:05.518" style="s2">There is the title restored under the</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.518" end="00:42:05.518" style="s2">commissioner&#39;s seal.</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.218" end="00:42:10.418" style="s2">They told me this would happen. Somebody</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.918" end="00:42:13.618" style="s2">from the floor some ministry paper</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.418" end="00:42:13.618" style="s2">understands one word.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.718" end="00:42:18.418" style="s2">And now the woman who will be your wife</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.718" end="00:42:21.718" style="s2">is a thief.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.418" end="00:42:21.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody used that word.</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.718" end="00:42:28.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who brought this to you, darling?</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.418" end="00:42:29.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A member of staff.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.118" end="00:42:31.718" style="s2">Leave it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.318" end="00:42:33.818" style="s2">I should have come to you first.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.718" end="00:42:36.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then go and sell your cement and let us</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.818" end="00:42:36.918" style="s2">never speak of it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.018" end="00:42:52.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Queen.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.118" end="00:42:53.720" style="s2">Who empties this?</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.018" end="00:42:55.320" style="s2">The wedding film wants one minute of</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.720" end="00:42:58.520" style="s2">mummy blessing me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.320" end="00:43:01.620" style="s2">Not that one. She looks hungry. Next.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.520" end="00:43:01.620" style="s2">The ground blessing call.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.420" end="00:43:09.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of them. I want to hear that the</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.520" end="00:43:09.520" style="s2">cleaners ate.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.104" end="00:43:18.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.520" end="00:43:20.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Queen,</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.620" end="00:43:23.020" style="s2">I have seen this.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.620" end="00:43:27.220" style="s2">Only that the old cleaner cut her thumb</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.020" end="00:43:27.220" style="s2">on your perfume glass, ma. Mama Sede.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.220" end="00:43:31.720" style="s2">The one who empties the bag.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.120" end="00:43:35.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked me, ma. Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.220" end="00:43:46.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tamara, stop it. Stop that noise and</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.220" end="00:43:49.520" style="s2">tell me what is on that screen.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.920" end="00:43:51.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told my mother-in-law to wipe my shoe</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.520" end="00:43:53.020" style="s2">with what she was wearing, and she did</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.620" end="00:43:56.120" style="s2">it, Kester.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.020" end="00:43:56.120" style="s2">She knelt down.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.220" end="00:44:02.720" style="s2">She has been carrying my bag out for</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.120" end="00:44:06.620" style="s2">nine weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.720" end="00:44:06.620" style="s2">Queen, go down to that store.</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.220" end="00:44:18.620" style="s2">Ma, the chairman&#39;s diary. Tomorrow at</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.720" end="00:44:20.020" style="s2">10:00 he meets his mother&#39;s lawyer here</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.620" end="00:44:23.020" style="s2">in the lobby.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.020" end="00:44:23.020" style="s2">They did not say why.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.520" end="00:44:30.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it is finished.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.620" end="00:44:31.920" style="s2">Tamara, I have a passport and a car.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.120" end="00:44:33.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She will not reach 10:00 with that in</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.920" end="00:44:36.320" style="s2">her head. Find out which way she goes up</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.720" end="00:44:36.320" style="s2">in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.635" end="00:44:41.655" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.420" end="00:44:53.320" style="s2">Good morning, mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.011" end="00:44:59.121" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.720" end="00:45:01.821" style="s2">So somebody looked at the thumb.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.121" end="00:45:03.321" style="s2">Nine weeks you have eaten my crumbs.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.821" end="00:45:06.021" style="s2">Name your price.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.321" end="00:45:07.721" style="s2">500 million naira and Houston is waiting</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.021" end="00:45:10.021" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.721" end="00:45:12.621" style="s2">You could not leave 10,000 naira in a</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.021" end="00:45:15.821" style="s2">cleaner&#39;s hand, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.621" end="00:45:15.821" style="s2">Keep your 500.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.221" end="00:45:19.921" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.921" end="00:45:22.121" style="s2">I will be good to him.</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.921" end="00:45:24.621" style="s2">I will give you grandchildren. I will</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.121" end="00:45:26.021" style="s2">kneel on this step and nobody will ever</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.621" end="00:45:27.821" style="s2">know.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.021" end="00:45:30.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have knelt for me on a cushion</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.821" end="00:45:30.321" style="s2">already.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.121" end="00:45:38.521" style="s2">Six years ago you spoke against one girl</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.321" end="00:45:40.721" style="s2">and he did not phone you for a year.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.521" end="00:45:42.621" style="s2">What will this cost you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.721" end="00:45:45.621" style="s2">He will look at that uniform and he will</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.621" end="00:45:47.521" style="s2">never forgive it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.621" end="00:45:50.121" style="s2">Perhaps</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.521" end="00:45:53.821" style="s2">at 10:00 my lawyer puts the ministry&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.121" end="00:45:55.521" style="s2">stamped copy in my son&#39;s hand.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.821" end="00:45:56.921" style="s2">You have until 10:00 to tell him</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.521" end="00:46:00.421" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.921" end="00:46:00.421" style="s2">I would do it for any girl.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.421" end="00:46:06.421" style="s2">Mind that step. It is wet.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.521" end="00:46:12.321" style="s2">Give me that.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.472" end="00:46:24.492" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.921" end="00:46:53.821" style="s2">Mama, it is Evi. Breathe for me, mama,</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.221" end="00:46:56.121" style="s2">slowly like that. Somebody, PLEASE</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.821" end="00:46:56.121" style="s2">SOMEBODY.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.921" end="00:47:01.922" style="s2">WHAT HAVE YOU TO HER?</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.323" end="00:47:04.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MA, I FOUND HER LIKE THIS. She is</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.922" end="00:47:07.422" style="s2">breathing. Please call a doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.422" end="00:47:10.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is nobody on these stairs but you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.422" end="00:47:12.023" style="s2">Look at the blood on your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.422" end="00:47:14.422" style="s2">What have you done to that poor old</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.023" end="00:47:14.422" style="s2">woman?</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.523" end="00:47:29.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How you were you come?</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.323" end="00:47:34.823" style="s2">Mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.823" end="00:47:42.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, this is Mama Sedi.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.037" end="00:47:45.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.323" end="00:47:48.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are in Houston?</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.723" end="00:47:48.823" style="s2">Mommy, you are in Houston?</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.922" end="00:47:58.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is MY MOTHER. MOVE. GET ME A CAR</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.223" end="00:47:58.223" style="s2">NOW. THIS IS MY MOTHER.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.723" end="00:48:12.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHE CLEANED A BANK.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.122" end="00:48:19.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. IKBE, there is bleeding around the</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.323" end="00:48:22.223" style="s2">brain. The one neurosurgeon who can do</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.523" end="00:48:23.922" style="s2">this is in Lagos.</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.223" end="00:48:25.223" style="s2">An air ambulance is waiting at the</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.922" end="00:48:28.122" style="s2">airport.</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.223" end="00:48:30.023" style="s2">It leaves in 40 minutes or not at all.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.122" end="00:48:31.122" style="s2">And it takes one relative,</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.023" end="00:48:33.223" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.122" end="00:48:35.622" style="s2">I will go.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.223" end="00:48:38.723" style="s2">God day, she is in Houston. Why was my</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.622" end="00:48:38.723" style="s2">mother in that uniform?</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.723" end="00:48:43.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman,</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.023" end="00:48:46.922" style="s2">Houston was a lie.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.922" end="00:48:49.723" style="s2">She came home 9 weeks ago.</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.922" end="00:48:51.523" style="s2">Every morning I took her to that lane</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.723" end="00:48:53.223" style="s2">behind the tower.</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.523" end="00:48:55.922" style="s2">And every evening</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.223" end="00:48:57.823" style="s2">I waited with the lamps low.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.922" end="00:48:59.924" style="s2">I told her to tell you</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.823" end="00:49:02.524" style="s2">she was afraid of losing you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.924" end="00:49:05.424" style="s2">Nine weeks? Why?</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.524" end="00:49:05.424" style="s2">She wanted to see.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.524" end="00:49:14.124" style="s2">Where is Evi?</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.124" end="00:49:14.124" style="s2">She was holding her head.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.824" end="00:49:17.924" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.124" end="00:49:19.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go, my love.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.924" end="00:49:22.599" style="s2">I will handle everything here. The girl,</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.924" end="00:49:23.124" style="s2">the police, the office.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.599" end="00:49:26.424" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.124" end="00:49:26.424" style="s2">She was the last one with her.</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.124" end="00:49:54.724" style="s2">Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.729" end="00:49:56.424" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.724" end="00:49:57.924" style="s2">Inspector, that old cleaner was the</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.424" end="00:50:00.724" style="s2">chairman&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.924" end="00:50:02.824" style="s2">She came here in secret, in a uniform, a</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.724" end="00:50:04.924" style="s2">mother&#39;s test of love for her son&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.824" end="00:50:05.924" style="s2">bride.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.924" end="00:50:08.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.924" end="00:50:11.824" style="s2">Our own Mama</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.024" end="00:50:11.824" style="s2">This girl made herself her friend.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.324" end="00:50:17.124" style="s2">She took her money and her confidence,</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.524" end="00:50:20.724" style="s2">and when she was found out, she pushed</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.124" end="00:50:20.724" style="s2">that old woman down my stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.824" end="00:50:26.424" style="s2">I held her head, ma. On those stairs,</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.824" end="00:50:29.124" style="s2">that is all I did.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.424" end="00:50:32.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Felix, you hold the keys.</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.124" end="00:50:32.224" style="s2">Bring what was in her locker.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.960" end="00:50:37.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.924" end="00:50:49.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The jacket is mine, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.824" end="00:50:49.124" style="s2">I have never seen that ring.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.624" end="00:50:54.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And inside her collar, inspector?</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.575" end="00:50:59.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.924" end="00:51:02.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exhibit one.</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.924" end="00:51:06.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She gave me that.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.525" end="00:51:06.125" style="s2">Who will believe a dustbin?</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.925" end="00:51:15.125" style="s2">Under our contract, a criminal forfeits</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.825" end="00:51:17.925" style="s2">every installment, but it is the same</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.125" end="00:51:17.925" style="s2">for everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.725" end="00:51:32.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This girl no fit kill fly. You people</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.625" end="00:51:32.125" style="s2">know her. Mr. Felix, talk now, talk.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.025" end="00:51:41.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at that. Two years by the service</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.125" end="00:51:43.425" style="s2">door, and at last she has found the</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.025" end="00:51:45.445" style="s2">front.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.425" end="00:51:45.445" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.625" end="00:52:09.825" style="s2">Hold it straight, Castor.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.825" end="00:52:11.525" style="s2">Two years I have feared one letter.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.825" end="00:52:14.125" style="s2">And it was down here beside a bowl of</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.525" end="00:52:14.125" style="s2">beans.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.725" end="00:52:21.425" style="s2">Nine weeks of my bag, and this is all?</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.525" end="00:52:23.425" style="s2">They say she sold paper to some man in a</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.425" end="00:52:26.325" style="s2">yard.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.425" end="00:52:29.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is rubbish, Tamara. A truck takes it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.325" end="00:52:32.625" style="s2">Forget paper. That old woman has a son,</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.225" end="00:52:34.325" style="s2">and that son has lawyers.</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.625" end="00:52:37.225" style="s2">Cancel the wedding, and we can be in</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.325" end="00:52:37.225" style="s2">Dubai by Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.225" end="00:52:47.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Book your Dubai for Sunday. Her son</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.525" end="00:52:50.725" style="s2">flies back to me on Saturday, grieving.</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.125" end="00:52:50.725" style="s2">Grieving men sign anything.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.025" end="00:53:07.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drink it while it is hot, pap, with</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.527" end="00:53:10.227" style="s2">plenty sugar.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.327" end="00:53:12.027" style="s2">How is Oye? Did she take her tablets?</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.227" end="00:53:15.627" style="s2">She took them. She is sleeping on my</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.027" end="00:53:15.627" style="s2">floor with my wrapper on her.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.527" end="00:53:20.227" style="s2">Why is my sister on your floor,</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.827" end="00:53:22.627" style="s2">Patience? We have a room. The video</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.227" end="00:53:24.127" style="s2">don&#39;t reach everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.627" end="00:53:25.827" style="s2">The thief who pushed the chairman&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.127" end="00:53:28.127" style="s2">mother.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.827" end="00:53:30.927" style="s2">Your landlord saw it and this morning he</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.127" end="00:53:35.127" style="s2">put your things on the road.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.927" end="00:53:35.127" style="s2">On the road? I was 12 the last time.</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.327" end="00:53:44.127" style="s2">Three years and she has finished it in</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.527" end="00:53:44.127" style="s2">one line.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.127" end="00:53:49.827" style="s2">And that old woman, all this time, the</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.927" end="00:53:52.027" style="s2">chairman&#39;s own mother.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.827" end="00:53:54.327" style="s2">She sat on my bed.</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.027" end="00:53:56.827" style="s2">She ate my beans.</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.327" end="00:54:00.727" style="s2">She let me refuse her money.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.827" end="00:54:00.727" style="s2">She was testing that woman, Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.127" end="00:54:09.227" style="s2">She was testing everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.227" end="00:54:12.527" style="s2">Her son has a mother.</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.227" end="00:54:12.527" style="s2">I thought I had one too.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.527" end="00:54:20.127" style="s2">There is one more thing</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.327" end="00:54:20.127" style="s2">and I will not carry it home with me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.527" end="00:54:24.827" style="s2">They are saying at the hospital that she</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.127" end="00:54:24.827" style="s2">may never wake.</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.127" end="00:54:46.527" style="s2">Two days in that chair, Mr. Igwe.</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.727" end="00:54:48.927" style="s2">The pressure is down [music] and the</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.527" end="00:54:52.627" style="s2">rest is her own work.</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.927" end="00:54:52.627" style="s2">The nurse found these in her uniform.</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.527" end="00:54:57.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On Tuesday you mopped the 14th floor so</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.627" end="00:54:59.273" style="s2">well that it embarrassed your</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.927" end="00:55:01.293" style="s2">colleagues.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.273" end="00:55:01.293" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.327" end="00:55:04.627" style="s2">Three queries, Mummy, from a man called</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.027" end="00:55:06.928" style="s2">Felix.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.627" end="00:55:09.628" style="s2">I walked past you, didn&#39;t I? Gode I</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.928" end="00:55:09.628" style="s2">walked past you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.928" end="00:55:14.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.028" end="00:55:20.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, it is me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.728" end="00:55:22.628" style="s2">Doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.528" end="00:55:23.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.628" end="00:55:25.228" style="s2">The shoe,</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.828" end="00:55:27.228" style="s2">the glass,</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.228" end="00:55:29.728" style="s2">her shredder.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.228" end="00:55:31.728" style="s2">Block C is a river.</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.728" end="00:55:34.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. Your lawyer gave me the stamped</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.728" end="00:55:35.928" style="s2">copy. There was no appeal.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.228" end="00:55:37.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then know the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.928" end="00:55:40.528" style="s2">On the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.928" end="00:55:42.928" style="s2">She pushed me, my son. The girl held my</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.528" end="00:55:42.928" style="s2">head.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.128" end="00:55:48.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tamara told the police it was Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.528" end="00:55:50.728" style="s2">Your ring was in her jacket.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.328" end="00:55:52.528" style="s2">She is in a cell, mommy, and her flat is</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.728" end="00:55:54.928" style="s2">gone, and I let that woman handle</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.528" end="00:55:54.928" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.228" end="00:55:58.828" style="s2">I am calling the commissioner of police.</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.228" end="00:56:05.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An old head, a fall, a good lawyer,</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.228" end="00:56:07.828" style="s2">and Kester flies with the money, and 412</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.928" end="00:56:09.928" style="s2">families have nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.828" end="00:56:12.128" style="s2">Let them think I am asleep. Let her walk</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.928" end="00:56:14.528" style="s2">to the table.</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.128" end="00:56:17.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to stand beside that woman</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.528" end="00:56:17.328" style="s2">and hold her pen?</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.528" end="00:56:20.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold it, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.044" end="00:56:29.064" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.728" end="00:56:42.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody knows I am in Benin,</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.128" end="00:56:42.328" style="s2">and nobody may know this.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.028" end="00:56:49.228" style="s2">My mother is awake.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.928" end="00:56:51.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who has been told, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.228" end="00:56:52.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Godé, the surgeon, and [music] you,</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.128" end="00:56:54.528" style="s2">because you have the right.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.728" end="00:56:57.174" style="s2">Tamara believes she is sleeping, and it</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.528" end="00:56:59.028" style="s2">must stay so.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.174" end="00:57:01.128" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.028" end="00:57:02.528" style="s2">You brought me the truth, and I went and</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.128" end="00:57:05.928" style="s2">asked the thief.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.528" end="00:57:05.928" style="s2">I have no speech to go with that.</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.028" end="00:57:11.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good, sir. I I heard enough speeches in</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.828" end="00:57:11.028" style="s2">that</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.129" end="00:57:15.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the ministry&#39;s stamped copy.</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.129" end="00:57:17.529" style="s2">Every word you read me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.829" end="00:57:20.229" style="s2">And this is your bill.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.529" end="00:57:20.229" style="s2">I have signed it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.129" end="00:57:26.829" style="s2">You could be outside in 10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.029" end="00:57:29.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A gift from the top of the stairs, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.829" end="00:57:29.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do I do?</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.529" end="00:57:35.729" style="s2">Then what do I do?</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.929" end="00:57:39.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign nothing on Saturday until I come.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.729" end="00:57:40.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And my mother, she asks.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.094" end="00:57:42.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.729" end="00:57:43.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell your mother I have no message for</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.229" end="00:57:45.729" style="s2">the chairman&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.729" end="00:57:48.129" style="s2">If I see Mama Sede, I will speak to Mama</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.729" end="00:57:48.129" style="s2">Sede.</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.429" end="00:57:52.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.829" end="00:57:55.329" style="s2">I will hold the door.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.929" end="00:57:57.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do that, sir. You have passed it 400</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.329" end="00:57:57.729" style="s2">times.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.829" end="00:58:15.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 150,000 Naira, inspector, for EVA</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.529" end="00:58:15.129" style="s2">Idahosa. Count them well.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.229" end="00:58:21.729" style="s2">Gate men, tea girls, the man who sells</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.929" end="00:58:21.729" style="s2">recharge cards.</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.629" end="00:58:33.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My own contribution, inspector, in my</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.929" end="00:58:33.829" style="s2">private capacity.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.929" end="00:58:37.029" style="s2">I require a receipt.</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.629" end="00:58:44.829" style="s2">Her paper money for this week.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.529" end="00:58:45.729" style="s2">My scale no they give discount.</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.829" end="00:58:48.129" style="s2">This one.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.729" end="00:58:49.629" style="s2">200 signatures and the money is correct,</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.129" end="00:58:52.729" style="s2">madam.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.629" end="00:58:55.729" style="s2">The law also wants a surety.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.729" end="00:58:57.929" style="s2">Who stands for this woman?</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.729" end="00:59:02.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of us. Right dustbin. That is what</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.929" end="00:59:02.029" style="s2">she CALLS US. WRITE 200 DUSTBINS.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.830" end="00:59:10.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.529" end="00:59:17.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You do not have this money.</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.431" end="00:59:19.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, we do not. That is why you can take</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.531" end="00:59:19.731" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.331" end="00:59:28.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will pay it back, every note.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.131" end="00:59:28.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We know. You will give us receipts.</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.431" end="00:59:33.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have been absent from your floor</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.831" end="00:59:34.431" style="s2">since Monday without a permission slip.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.531" end="00:59:37.031" style="s2">No query.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.431" end="00:59:40.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baba, has the truck come?</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.031" end="00:59:40.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saturday, dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.831" end="00:59:53.731" style="s2">For the record, I swept out that steel</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.931" end="00:59:55.731" style="s2">bin myself. The ash had tape in it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.731" end="00:59:57.731" style="s2">Every sheet you and Mama Sade joined is</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.731" end="00:59:59.931" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.731" end="01:00:03.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She burned what we taped, Mr. Felix. She</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.931" end="01:00:03.331" style="s2">did not burn what we sold.</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.131" end="01:00:12.331" style="s2">Baba, every week since July I brought</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.431" end="01:00:12.331" style="s2">you floor 14.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.831" end="01:00:19.031" style="s2">Where is it?</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.231" end="01:00:21.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; July, August, all inside that one.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.031" end="01:00:23.831" style="s2">Nobody comes here to find.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.131" end="01:00:26.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Them only come to sell.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.831" end="01:00:26.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have come to find.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.631" end="01:00:36.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ifeanyi,</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.031" end="01:00:37.731" style="s2">this is your small small handwriting.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.131" end="01:00:40.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever went through her machine came</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.731" end="01:00:42.431" style="s2">to me in a bag and I sold it by the</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.031" end="01:00:42.431" style="s2">kilo.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.631" end="01:00:49.831" style="s2">40 families signed a petition about</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.631" end="01:00:52.731" style="s2">Block C.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.831" end="01:00:56.031" style="s2">She wrote on it and ordered it shredded.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.731" end="01:00:56.031" style="s2">It is somewhere on this floor.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.931" end="01:01:05.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I carried the first six in my keke</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.831" end="01:01:08.931" style="s2">and one of them gave me a tip.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.931" end="01:01:10.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ifeanyi, which day did it go in?</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.931" end="01:01:14.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know the day she said it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.731" end="01:01:14.331" style="s2">I do not know the day it went in.</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.731" end="01:01:18.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 90 bags. I have counted them twice, done</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.032" end="01:01:20.532" style="s2">in 7 hours a way.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.332" end="01:01:22.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop counting, Mr. Felix, and kneel</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.532" end="01:01:22.932" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.732" end="01:01:35.132" style="s2">Hm, who invited this one?</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.532" end="01:01:37.532" style="s2">Sorry, everybody.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.132" end="01:01:40.232" style="s2">Evi, I put the ring in your jacket. She</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.532" end="01:01:43.732" style="s2">told me to and I did it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.232" end="01:01:43.732" style="s2">I have not slept since Monday.</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.032" end="01:01:52.532" style="s2">Why are you in this yard?</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.432" end="01:01:55.132" style="s2">You took the bottle for me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.532" end="01:01:56.432" style="s2">You said I knocked it, ma, and you had</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.132" end="01:01:59.132" style="s2">not.</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.432" end="01:02:01.332" style="s2">Nobody had ever done that.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.132" end="01:02:03.032" style="s2">She wrote on it in gold at the basin</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.332" end="01:02:05.832" style="s2">because nothing leaves that desk without</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.032" end="01:02:05.832" style="s2">her gold ink.</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.532" end="01:02:12.132" style="s2">She told me through the machine</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.432" end="01:02:15.332" style="s2">I could not do it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.132" end="01:02:18.532" style="s2">For 9 days it lay in my drawer.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.332" end="01:02:21.432" style="s2">Then came my mother&#39;s rent day and I fed</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.532" end="01:02:25.632" style="s2">it in myself.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.432" end="01:02:25.632" style="s2">You put it in. Help me bring it out.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.832" end="01:02:35.832" style="s2">Gold, Evi, see gold.</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.732" end="01:02:45.732" style="s2">And after that, the very words she said</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.532" end="01:02:45.732" style="s2">to her mirror signed T.</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.032" end="01:02:51.532" style="s2">Baba, the truck.</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.932" end="01:02:56.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him blow.</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.732" end="01:02:59.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will say it in front of her, in front</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.832" end="01:03:03.432" style="s2">of all of them.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.432" end="01:03:03.432" style="s2">Then wear something you can stand up in.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.732" end="01:03:19.232" style="s2">You are late, Mama Sede.</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.132" end="01:03:21.633" style="s2">That is a query.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.232" end="01:03:24.233" style="s2">You let me refuse your money.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.633" end="01:03:26.233" style="s2">I did.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.233" end="01:03:29.233" style="s2">I told you where my mother&#39;s pot went</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.233" end="01:03:29.233" style="s2">and you sat there.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.533" end="01:03:34.933" style="s2">I did.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.733" end="01:03:37.633" style="s2">I sat on your bed and let you be poor in</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.933" end="01:03:37.633" style="s2">front of me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.333" end="01:03:42.333" style="s2">I have no excuse, my child,</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.659" end="01:03:44.333" style="s2">[music] only the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.333" end="01:03:46.733" style="s2">I went to test one woman</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.333" end="01:03:48.333" style="s2">and I found my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.733" end="01:03:50.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That word will have to wait its turn,</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.333" end="01:03:50.633" style="s2">mama.</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.433" end="01:04:06.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The surgeon says madam must not stand.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.333" end="01:04:09.133" style="s2">She made me sign for her like a parcel.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.433" end="01:04:11.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For that hole I can stand.</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.133" end="01:04:15.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Also the chairman has sent a dress for</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.333" end="01:04:15.433" style="s2">you, Miss Evi, and a car.</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.533" end="01:04:20.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank him and send them back.</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.933" end="01:04:23.333" style="s2">She knows this uniform.</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.133" end="01:04:23.333" style="s2">Let her watch it walk in.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.033" end="01:04:30.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The river has reached you, my child.</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.633" end="01:04:32.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It has reached the boatman&#39;s red, mama,</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.233" end="01:04:36.033" style="s2">and it did not wait for October.</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.633" end="01:04:36.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what is in the bucket?</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.989" end="01:04:41.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.533" end="01:04:41.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My house.</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.019" end="01:04:56.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.033" end="01:05:04.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See that brave girl. Her mother-in-law</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.333" end="01:05:06.333" style="s2">lies in a coma in Lagos, pushed by a</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.833" end="01:05:08.733" style="s2">cleaner.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.333" end="01:05:11.933" style="s2">And still she stands up to smile to</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.733" end="01:05:11.933" style="s2">smile for us.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.333" end="01:05:19.033" style="s2">That is a saint.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.333" end="01:05:21.435" style="s2">Mommy cannot be with us tonight. She is</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.033" end="01:05:23.135" style="s2">fighting for her life and I know she is</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.435" end="01:05:25.535" style="s2">smiling.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.135" end="01:05:27.535" style="s2">I pray for her knees every morning.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.535" end="01:05:29.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tamara, that man has not touched his</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.535" end="01:05:32.035" style="s2">rice.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.735" end="01:05:34.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He will eat on Monday. Dry your neck and</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.035" end="01:05:34.535" style="s2">smile.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.135" end="01:05:40.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who can cry like that and still look</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.035" end="01:05:42.235" style="s2">like that? Ladies and gentlemen, before</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.135" end="01:05:43.735" style="s2">the rings, before the cake, the wedding</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.235" end="01:05:46.435" style="s2">gift.</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.735" end="01:05:47.730" style="s2">3 billion naira from the chairman to his</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.435" end="01:05:49.750" style="s2">bride.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.730" end="01:05:49.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering and applause]</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.835" end="01:05:59.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My bride says her workers are her own</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.735" end="01:06:03.450" style="s2">blood.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.935" end="01:06:03.835" style="s2">Her oldest workers should bless this.</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.450" end="01:06:04.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.835" end="01:06:07.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darling,</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.935" end="01:06:07.835" style="s2">which workers?</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.535" end="01:06:24.735" style="s2">That is the girl from the video. That is</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.435" end="01:06:28.035" style="s2">the thief.</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.735" end="01:06:30.135" style="s2">Security, remove that woman.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.035" end="01:06:32.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.135" end="01:06:34.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Walk please, my sister. Today you dey</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.235" end="01:06:34.835" style="s2">for wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.301" end="01:06:51.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.335" end="01:06:56.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last time a microphone came near me,</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.435" end="01:06:59.335" style="s2">madam read out my staff card. So let me</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.535" end="01:07:01.435" style="s2">finish it. My name is Ivy.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.335" end="01:07:04.635" style="s2">I cleaned this woman&#39;s floors.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.435" end="01:07:08.435" style="s2">For 3 years I paid her 1,200,000</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.635" end="01:07:10.935" style="s2">naira for block C, flat 6.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.435" end="01:07:12.535" style="s2">This morning I went to collect my kima.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.935" end="01:07:15.435" style="s2">The river was at the red band on the</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.535" end="01:07:15.435" style="s2">boatman&#39;s pole.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.735" end="01:07:20.735" style="s2">This is block C.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.136" end="01:07:32.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Ministry of Lands stamped to madam</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.636" end="01:07:34.436" style="s2">by name two years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.536" end="01:07:36.836" style="s2">All the land past the show house is</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.436" end="01:07:40.136" style="s2">flood plain.</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.836" end="01:07:42.536" style="s2">Title revoked, no building permitted.</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.136" end="01:07:44.321" style="s2">She has known for two years and she took</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.536" end="01:07:45.936" style="s2">my money last month.</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.321" end="01:07:49.436" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.936" end="01:07:52.036" style="s2">412 families, a cook,</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.436" end="01:07:56.036" style="s2">a gate man, a nurse.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.036" end="01:07:58.836" style="s2">Every naira went to one debt in Lagos.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.036" end="01:08:00.536" style="s2">1.8 billion due this Monday.</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.836" end="01:08:03.036" style="s2">Tonight the chairman&#39;s pen was to clear</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.536" end="01:08:06.236" style="s2">that debt and the river and the river</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.036" end="01:08:07.736" style="s2">was to keep our flats.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.236" end="01:08:10.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, is that not where we bought for</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.736" end="01:08:10.236" style="s2">our driver?</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.136" end="01:08:21.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My darlings, forgive this.</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.736" end="01:08:24.936" style="s2">She is a thief out on bail</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.336" end="01:08:24.936" style="s2">and she has been in my rubbish.</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.136" end="01:08:28.536" style="s2">That is where you put the truth, ma.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.536" end="01:08:44.836" style="s2">40 families signed this to ask for their</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.536" end="01:08:47.836" style="s2">money back.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.836" end="01:08:47.836" style="s2">She had it shredded.</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.936" end="01:08:52.536" style="s2">It took a thousand joins of tape</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.436" end="01:08:54.536" style="s2">on our knees on the floor of a paper</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.536" end="01:08:57.836" style="s2">yard.</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.536" end="01:09:00.736" style="s2">The answer is written across the top.</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.836" end="01:09:03.536" style="s2">Do not refund. Poor people do not read.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.736" end="01:09:03.536" style="s2">They only pay.</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.236" end="01:09:07.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I read, ma.</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.336" end="01:09:17.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is a lie. That page was shredded. I</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.536" end="01:09:19.736" style="s2">ordered it through through the machine</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.136" end="01:09:19.736" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.608" end="01:09:25.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.236" end="01:09:25.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tamara, stop talking. She said shredded.</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.336" end="01:09:27.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did she</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.538" end="01:09:29.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; just say shredded?</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.938" end="01:09:33.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me somebody from the floor</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.838" end="01:09:37.038" style="s2">understood one word, Tamara.</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.637" end="01:09:38.538" style="s2">She has read you a whole page.</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.038" end="01:09:40.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma. And who do you think carried</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.538" end="01:09:43.038" style="s2">the bag? Nothing thrown away is ever</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.637" end="01:09:43.038" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.038" end="01:09:48.737" style="s2">Sorry, everybody. Not you, ma.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.038" end="01:09:50.438" style="s2">Nothing leaves that desk without her</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.737" end="01:09:53.237" style="s2">gold ink.</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.438" end="01:09:56.137" style="s2">That is how we know the word is hers.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.237" end="01:09:59.538" style="s2">And she told me to put the coral ring in</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.137" end="01:10:02.838" style="s2">Ivy&#39;s jacket. I did it.</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.538" end="01:10:02.838" style="s2">I will say it to anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.338" end="01:10:13.038" style="s2">Look at you, all of you, liar and a bag</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.637" end="01:10:13.038" style="s2">of rubbish. Who will believe a dustbin?</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.438" end="01:10:20.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which of the two, my daughter? You had</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.137" end="01:10:20.538" style="s2">two.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.338" end="01:10:38.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are in a coma.</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.637" end="01:10:41.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.938" end="01:10:44.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should visit more.</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.938" end="01:10:48.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, the surgeon said</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.838" end="01:10:48.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The surgeon is in Lagos, Godee.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.137" end="01:10:58.938" style="s2">I am Omoshalewa Igbe, this man&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.038" end="01:11:00.637" style="s2">And for nine weeks I emptied this</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.938" end="01:11:04.738" style="s2">woman&#39;s bin.</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.637" end="01:11:04.738" style="s2">He&#39;s just so into in this coming.</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.438" end="01:11:14.538" style="s2">The shoe in front of your buyers.</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.038" end="01:11:16.938" style="s2">The envelope, 10,000 naira for the</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.538" end="01:11:19.538" style="s2">photos.</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.938" end="01:11:21.438" style="s2">The glass with bare hands.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.538" end="01:11:23.137" style="s2">20 minutes after you prayed for my</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.438" end="01:11:24.538" style="s2">knees.</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.137" end="01:11:25.938" style="s2">The stairs</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.538" end="01:11:29.239" style="s2">with both</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.938" end="01:11:30.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, if I had known it was you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.239" end="01:11:33.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.339" end="01:11:35.039" style="s2">That is the whole of it, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.039" end="01:11:37.739" style="s2">If you had known.</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.039" end="01:11:40.739" style="s2">I came to see how you treat the woman</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.739" end="01:11:43.539" style="s2">who empties your bin.</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.739" end="01:11:43.539" style="s2">And I have seen.</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.939" end="01:11:53.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I walked past you mummy</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.839" end="01:11:55.239" style="s2">at the lift with your bucket at my feet.</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.439" end="01:11:58.339" style="s2">At the blessing with the tray in your</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.239" end="01:12:03.239" style="s2">hands. I said thank you to the tray.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.339" end="01:12:03.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did. Get up. Now look at her.</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.739" end="01:12:19.480" style="s2">Wipe it yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.460" end="01:12:19.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.735" end="01:12:22.755" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.339" end="01:12:29.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no gift and there is no</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.939" end="01:12:32.139" style="s2">wedding. Send the rice home with the</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.639" end="01:12:32.139" style="s2">cleaners.</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.539" end="01:12:40.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Efosa, my love. I did it for us.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.639" end="01:12:41.939" style="s2">All of it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.039" end="01:12:44.639" style="s2">Who stood beside you in that hospital</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.939" end="01:12:48.239" style="s2">when your mother fell?</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.639" end="01:12:48.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Efosa to came to time.</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.539" end="01:12:57.239" style="s2">Monday sent. I sell what I hold and the</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.439" end="01:12:59.539" style="s2">newspapers will not need me to tell them</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.239" end="01:12:59.539" style="s2">why.</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.000" end="01:13:04.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.639" end="01:13:09.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The signature, the certificate, the</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.539" end="01:13:12.439" style="s2">account in Dubai. I only did what the</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.639" end="01:13:12.439" style="s2">gold pen wrote.</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.639" end="01:13:15.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You forged that certificate with your</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.539" end="01:13:19.439" style="s2">own hand.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.939" end="01:13:19.439" style="s2">You wet little man.</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.340" end="01:13:23.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.639" end="01:13:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said the old woman would not reach</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.439" end="01:13:26.639" style="s2">10 o&#39;clock.</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.839" end="01:13:30.539" style="s2">I heard you say it.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.639" end="01:13:30.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And to think I sprayed this girl money.</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.540" end="01:13:44.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The charge against this woman is</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.840" end="01:13:44.740" style="s2">withdrawn, madam, with my apology.</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.816" end="01:13:51.836" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.340" end="01:13:58.140" style="s2">Fraud, the two of you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.440" end="01:14:00.540" style="s2">And for you, the attempted murder of</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.140" end="01:14:00.540" style="s2">madam</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.226" end="01:14:11.240" style="s2">[cheering] Mummy, mummy, please.</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.740" end="01:14:11.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am resting, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.431" end="01:14:13.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.240" end="01:14:30.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The safe is done, madam. The van is at</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.040" end="01:14:32.040" style="s2">the front doors.</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.340" end="01:14:34.440" style="s2">You sent a girl out through them, so you</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.040" end="01:14:34.440" style="s2">know the way.</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.740" end="01:14:41.340" style="s2">Your personal effects, madam. One framed</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.840" end="01:14:43.340" style="s2">magazine cover, one small gold bean.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.340" end="01:14:44.640" style="s2">Things go in, madam, you carry them out.</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.340" end="01:14:46.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Queen</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.640" end="01:14:48.540" style="s2">My phone</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.040" end="01:14:50.440" style="s2">Call my lawyer.</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.540" end="01:14:53.240" style="s2">It is in the bag, ma. I do not carry</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.440" end="01:14:53.240" style="s2">your things again.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.740" end="01:15:02.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Phones may stay up.</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.440" end="01:15:04.540" style="s2">Tonight, this lobby is a cinema.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.540" end="01:15:06.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, 10,000 naira, because in this</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.540" end="01:15:10.240" style="s2">company, the cleaner is family. Come</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.940" end="01:15:12.940" style="s2">closer, make them see your good side.</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.240" end="01:15:12.940" style="s2">Smile.</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.340" end="01:15:19.140" style="s2">It was for the photos. Family does not</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.440" end="01:15:19.140" style="s2">count money.</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.640" end="01:15:30.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam My resignation, madam. I was only</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.340" end="01:15:30.640" style="s2">laughing because of the job.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.840" end="01:15:37.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You you have won?</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.442" end="01:15:40.642" style="s2">you are still a cleaner.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.042" end="01:15:40.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma. Mind the floor.</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.942" end="01:16:03.942" style="s2">That is all 412, ma. Repaid or moved to</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.342" end="01:16:03.942" style="s2">dry land on the Sapele Road.</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.042" end="01:16:10.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So says the head of the buyer&#39;s office,</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.142" end="01:16:10.842" style="s2">a post she laid out herself.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.742" end="01:16:20.242" style="s2">The group pays her accounts exams as a</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.242" end="01:16:20.242" style="s2">term of the job.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.642" end="01:16:27.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A term, ma, not a gift.</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.042" end="01:16:30.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, those are my queries in gold. I</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.242" end="01:16:32.942" style="s2">will explain in writing within 24 hours</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.242" end="01:16:35.142" style="s2">why action should not be taken.</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.942" end="01:16:38.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are promoted, Mr. Felix.</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.142" end="01:16:42.042" style="s2">You will teach my new directors to mop.</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.442" end="01:16:43.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is in the manual, madam.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.042" end="01:16:46.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My cleaners don&#39;t collect envelopes</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.642" end="01:16:48.842" style="s2">today, oh, real ones, and nobody brought</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.042" end="01:16:48.842" style="s2">anything back.</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.342" end="01:16:53.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The paper contract is good,</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.442" end="01:16:56.842" style="s2">chairman.</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.442" end="01:16:59.142" style="s2">My skill still gives no discount.</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.842" end="01:17:02.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Queen, the refund desk is yours on one</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.142" end="01:17:05.742" style="s2">condition. You will tell me everything</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.142" end="01:17:05.742" style="s2">every day. Every day, ma.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.842" end="01:17:11.142" style="s2">The last of my installment on the dry</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.642" end="01:17:13.523" style="s2">flat and the last of your clinic&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.142" end="01:17:14.142" style="s2">1,800.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.523" end="01:17:16.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.142" end="01:17:17.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 70</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.242" end="01:17:19.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paid in full.</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.742" end="01:17:21.442" style="s2">See you on the fourth step.</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.542" end="01:17:22.842" style="s2">Sir, that is not how a receipt is</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.442" end="01:17:25.842" style="s2">written.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.842" end="01:17:25.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then send me a query.</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.642" end="01:17:38.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Efe,</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.942" end="01:17:40.643" style="s2">water side living, and water is staying</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.343" end="01:17:43.543" style="s2">outside.</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.643" end="01:17:46.743" style="s2">Come and listen to it not coming in.</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.543" end="01:17:49.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I sent Gode to look for the real one.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.743" end="01:17:51.643" style="s2">14 years is too long.</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.943" end="01:17:53.543" style="s2">So I bought the oldest pot in Benin</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.643" end="01:17:55.143" style="s2">market.</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.543" end="01:17:57.543" style="s2">This is for the one they put on the</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.143" end="01:17:57.543" style="s2">road.</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.643" end="01:18:06.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My condition ma,</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.243" end="01:18:08.543" style="s2">no more uniforms,</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.343" end="01:18:11.543" style="s2">no more secrets.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.543" end="01:18:14.643" style="s2">If you want to know me, ask me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.543" end="01:18:16.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am asking, not the chairman&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.643" end="01:18:18.243" style="s2">Only an old cleaner who ate half of your</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.643" end="01:18:20.843" style="s2">beans.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.243" end="01:18:22.443" style="s2">May she call you her daughter?</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.843" end="01:18:23.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then yes mama.</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.443" end="01:18:26.743" style="s2">I belong to you</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.943" end="01:18:26.743" style="s2">and you to me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.043" end="01:18:31.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That half is yours. I measured it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.543" end="01:18:38.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have wiped my own footprints all the</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.243" end="01:18:38.143" style="s2">way from the stairs.</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.543" end="01:18:43.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Left hand low sir.</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.443" end="01:18:43.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is your name?</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.743" end="01:18:49.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask me in a year sir.</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.643" end="01:18:49.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will be on the fourth step.</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.543" end="01:19:07.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is new.</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.243" end="01:19:07.543" style="s2">Let me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.043" end="01:19:18.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning. What is your name?</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.643" end="01:19:19.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me sir.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.343" end="01:19:21.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.343" end="01:19:23.869" style="s2">I started late, so I am catching up on</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.643" end="01:19:25.889" style="s2">this whole building.</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.869" end="01:19:25.889" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.143" end="01:19:34.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I taught that boy to greet the gate man.</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.743" end="01:19:37.243" style="s2">It took him 36 years.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.743" end="01:19:39.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me your arm. Do not look at them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.243" end="01:19:42.045" style="s2">Look at the floor and we will both</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.045" end="01:19:42.045" style="s2">finish this shift.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.445" end="01:19:50.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, please do not report me. I sell the</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.744" end="01:19:53.545" style="s2">paper by the It is only rubbish, ma, and</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.945" end="01:19:55.945" style="s2">you are a director.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.545" end="01:19:58.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Read it before you sell it. Nobody stops</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.945" end="01:19:58.945" style="s2">a cleaner from reading.</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.744" end="01:20:07.844" style="s2">Number 47, it has survived worse women.</p>
<p begin="01:20:05.144" end="01:20:07.844" style="s2">Keep the bag.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.144" end="01:20:12.045" style="s2">Nothing thrown away is ever gone.</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.475" end="01:20:25.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
